  "components": [
    {
      "name": "Button",
      "kind": "button",
      "refersTo": "button",
      "description": "Default control: paper face, strong-rule border.",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-btn\">Snooze</button>",
      "css": ".ds-btn{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:6px;min-height:36px;padding:0 14px;border-radius:var(--radius,3px);border:1px solid var(--rule-strong,#9db9d8);background:var(--paper,#fbfcfd);color:var(--ink,#1b1e24);font:650 0.8125rem/1.2 'Archivo Variable','Archivo',system-ui,sans-serif;cursor:pointer;transition:background-color 120ms ease-out,border-color 120ms ease-out}.ds-btn:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--blue,#1f4b99);outline-offset:2px}.ds-btn:hover{background:var(--ground,#f0f3f7);border-color:var(--muted,#545c69)}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Primary Button",
      "kind": "button",
      "refersTo": "button-primary",
      "description": "Ballpoint-blue main action: Resolve, Check, Send.",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-btn ds-btn-primary\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><circle cx=\"11\" cy=\"11\" r=\"6\"/><path d=\"M15.5 15.5L20 20\"/></svg>Check</button>",
      "css": ".ds-btn{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:6px;min-height:36px;padding:0 14px;border-radius:var(--radius,3px);border:1px solid var(--rule-strong,#9db9d8);background:var(--paper,#fbfcfd);color:var(--ink,#1b1e24);font:650 0.8125rem/1.2 'Archivo Variable','Archivo',system-ui,sans-serif;cursor:pointer;transition:background-color 120ms ease-out,border-color 120ms ease-out}.ds-btn:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--blue,#1f4b99);outline-offset:2px}.ds-btn-primary{background:var(--blue,#1f4b99);border-color:var(--blue,#1f4b99);color:var(--paper,#fbfcfd)}.ds-btn-primary:hover{background:color-mix(in oklab,var(--blue,#1f4b99) 86%,var(--ink,#1b1e24))}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Danger Button",
      "kind": "button",
      "refersTo": "button-danger",
      "description": "Delete, set apart from Resolve.",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-btn ds-btn-danger\">Delete</button>",
      "css": ".ds-btn{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:6px;min-height:36px;padding:0 14px;border-radius:var(--radius,3px);border:1px solid var(--rule-strong,#9db9d8);background:var(--paper,#fbfcfd);color:var(--ink,#1b1e24);font:650 0.8125rem/1.2 'Archivo Variable','Archivo',system-ui,sans-serif;cursor:pointer;transition:background-color 120ms ease-out,border-color 120ms ease-out}.ds-btn:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--blue,#1f4b99);outline-offset:2px}.ds-btn-danger{color:var(--red,#c42127);border-color:color-mix(in oklab,var(--red,#c42127) 45%,transparent);background:transparent}.ds-btn-danger:hover{background:var(--red-wash,#fcecec);border-color:var(--red,#c42127)}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Text Input",
      "kind": "input",
      "refersTo": "input",
      "description": "Native field on paper, blue focus.",
      "html": "<input class=\"ds-input\" type=\"text\" placeholder=\"Type a message…\">",
      "css": ".ds-input{width:280px;min-height:38px;padding:8px 10px;border:1px solid var(--rule-strong,#9db9d8);border-radius:3px;background:var(--paper,#fbfcfd);color:var(--ink,#1b1e24);font:400 0.9375rem/1.4 'Archivo Variable','Archivo',system-ui,sans-serif}.ds-input::placeholder{color:var(--muted,#545c69)}.ds-input:hover{border-color:var(--muted,#545c69)}.ds-input:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--blue,#1f4b99);outline-offset:0;border-color:var(--blue,#1f4b99)}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Cover Band",
      "kind": "nav",
      "refersTo": "band",
      "description": "555-red band on every page: wordmark, the day's count in 62%-width black numerals, actions.",
      "html": "<header class=\"ds-band\"><a class=\"ds-wordmark\" href=\"#\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"26\" height=\"26\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><rect x=\"5\" y=\"3\" width=\"14\" height=\"18\" rx=\"1.5\"/><path d=\"M8.5 3v18M11.5 8.5h4.5M11.5 12h4.5M11 15.6c1.6-.5 3.4.4 5.6-.3\"/></svg>Continuum</a><div class=\"ds-tally\"><span class=\"ds-tally-n\">3</span><span class=\"ds-tally-l\">need you today</span></div><button class=\"ds-on-cover\">Check a message</button></header>",
      "css": ".ds-band{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:24px;flex-wrap:wrap;padding:16px 24px;background:var(--cover,#c42127);color:#fff;font-family:'Archivo Variable','Archivo',system-ui,sans-serif}.ds-wordmark{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;color:inherit;text-decoration:none;font-weight:750;font-stretch:112%;font-size:1.25rem;letter-spacing:-0.01em}.ds-tally{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;margin-left:auto}.ds-tally-n{font-size:4rem;font-weight:900;font-stretch:62%;line-height:.82;letter-spacing:-0.02em;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}.ds-tally-l{font-size:1.0625rem;font-weight:650;line-height:1.15;max-width:9ch;color:#fde3e4}.ds-on-cover{min-height:36px;padding:0 14px;border-radius:3px;border:1px solid rgb(255 255 255 / .55);background:transparent;color:#fff;font:650 .8125rem 'Archivo Variable','Archivo',system-ui,sans-serif;cursor:pointer;transition:background-color 120ms ease-out}.ds-on-cover:hover{background:var(--cover-deep,#9f191e);border-color:#fff}.ds-on-cover:focus-visible{outline:2px solid #fff;outline-offset:2px}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Verdict Chip",
      "kind": "chip",
      "refersTo": "chip",
      "description": "Outline tag in the verdict's ink; never fills.",
      "html": "<span class=\"ds-chip ds-chip-warn\">Contradicted</span> <span class=\"ds-chip ds-chip-ok\">Official</span>",
      "css": ".ds-chip{display:inline-block;padding:1px 7px;border:1px solid currentColor;border-radius:2px;font:700 .75rem/1.5 'Archivo Variable','Archivo',system-ui,sans-serif;white-space:nowrap}.ds-chip-warn{color:var(--red,#c42127)}.ds-chip-ok{color:var(--blue,#1f4b99)}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Sheet",
      "kind": "card",
      "refersTo": "sheet",
      "description": "Paper sheet on the ground with a 2px ink-ruled head.",
      "html": "<section class=\"ds-sheet\"><div class=\"ds-head\"><h2>Owed to you</h2><span class=\"ds-count\">4</span></div><p>Entries go here.</p></section>",
      "css": ".ds-sheet{max-width:420px;background:var(--paper,#fbfcfd);border:1px solid var(--rule,#d5e2f0);border-radius:3px;padding:24px;box-shadow:0 1px 2px rgb(27 30 36 / .05);color:var(--ink,#1b1e24);font:400 .9375rem/1.5 'Archivo Variable','Archivo',system-ui,sans-serif}.ds-head{display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:12px;padding-bottom:8px;border-bottom:2px solid var(--ink,#1b1e24);margin-bottom:12px}.ds-head h2{margin:0;font-size:1.5rem;font-weight:800;font-stretch:92%;letter-spacing:-0.01em}.ds-count{font-size:1.0625rem;font-weight:600;color:var(--muted,#545c69);font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Margined Ledger Rows",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "entry",
      "description": "Ruled entries with the double red margin, a red flag column, and the ballpoint strike through a settled entry.",
      "html": "<ul class=\"ds-rows\"><li><div class=\"ds-entry\"><span class=\"ds-flag\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"8.5\"/><path d=\"M12 7.6v5.2\"/><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"16.3\" r=\".9\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\"/></svg></span><span class=\"ds-t\"><b>Pay RM250 deposit to Apex Careers</b><small>Risk signals</small></span><span class=\"ds-due ds-late\">2 days late</span></div></li><li><div class=\"ds-entry\"><span></span><span class=\"ds-t ds-settled\"><b>Send CV to Aina</b><small>You owe</small><svg class=\"ds-strike\" viewBox=\"0 0 100 10\" preserveAspectRatio=\"none\"><path pathLength=\"1\" vector-effect=\"non-scaling-stroke\" d=\"M1 6.2C18 3.6 36 7.4 55 4.8S86 5.6 99 3.4\"/></svg></span><span class=\"ds-due ds-soon\">Fri</span></div></li></ul>",
      "css": ".ds-rows{list-style:none;margin:0;padding:0;max-width:480px;background:var(--paper,#fbfcfd) linear-gradient(to right,transparent 39px,var(--margin,#eb9a9e) 39px 40px,transparent 40px 43px,var(--margin,#eb9a9e) 43px 44px,transparent 44px);font:400 .9375rem/1.5 'Archivo Variable','Archivo',system-ui,sans-serif;color:var(--ink,#1b1e24)}.ds-rows>li{border-bottom:1px solid var(--rule,#d5e2f0)}.ds-entry{display:grid;grid-template-columns:38px minmax(0,1fr) auto;align-items:center;gap:12px;min-height:48px;padding:8px 4px 8px 0}.ds-flag{color:var(--red,#c42127);display:grid;place-items:center}.ds-t{position:relative;min-width:0}.ds-t b{display:block;font-size:1.0625rem;font-weight:650}.ds-t small{display:block;font-size:.8125rem;color:var(--muted,#545c69)}.ds-settled b,.ds-settled small{color:var(--muted,#545c69)}.ds-due{font-size:.8125rem;color:var(--muted,#545c69);font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;white-space:nowrap}.ds-late{color:var(--red,#c42127);font-weight:650}.ds-soon{color:var(--blue,#1f4b99);font-weight:600}.ds-strike{position:absolute;left:-2px;top:.62em;width:calc(100% + 4px);height:10px;overflow:visible;pointer-events:none}.ds-strike path{fill:none;stroke:var(--blue,#1f4b99);stroke-width:2.2;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-dasharray:1;stroke-dashoffset:1;animation:ds-strike 420ms cubic-bezier(.2,.7,.2,1) forwards}@keyframes ds-strike{to{stroke-dashoffset:0}}@media (prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-strike path{animation:none;stroke-dashoffset:0}}"
    }
  ],
  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "The Buku 555 Pocket Ledger",
    "overview": "Continuum is kept like the kedai runcit's 555 book: a red cover band on top, cool white ruled sheets underneath, graphite handwriting-weight ink. What you owe, what's owed to you, and requests that want your money are entries on lines, not cards on a board. The system refuses the SaaS task board (sidebar, card grid, blue-accent chrome) and the dark threat console.\n\nTwo inks carry meaning and nothing else gets colour. Red is Continuum's warning: risk signals, overdue, payment asks not yet checked. Ballpoint blue is settled and yours: resolve, soon, supports, your own chat messages. The ledger's furniture (pale-blue rules, the double red margin, the cover band) stays the same in every state, so meaning comes only from which ink an entry is written in.\n\nDensity is a working notebook: 48px rows, small type, tabular numerals, no decorative imagery. The one flourish is the strike: settling an entry draws a single ballpoint line through it, in place. This is an Operate-mode product; controls, inputs and menus stay standard and legible.",
